{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\t// Internal register file\n\treg [DW-1:0] mem [0:(2**(AW-APBLSB)-1)];\n\n\t// Address decode\n\twire [AW-APBLSB-1:0] addr_index = PADDR[AW-1:APBLSB];\n\n\t// Write enable\n\twire write_en = PSEL & PENABLE & PWRITE;\n\n\t// Read enable\n\twire read_en = PSEL & PENABLE & ~PWRITE;\n\n\t// Write data with strobes\n\treg [DW-1:0] write_data;\n\tinteger i;\n\talways @* begin\n\t\twrite_data = PWDATA;\n\t\tfor (i = 0; i < DW/8; i = i + 1) begin\n\t\t\tif (!PWSTRB[i]) begin\n\t\t\t\twrite_data[i*8 +: 8] = 8'h00;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Sequential logic\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t// PREADY is asserted during access phase\n\t\t\tif (PSEL & PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t// Write to memory\n\t\t\tif (write_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tmem[addr_index] <= write_data;\n\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t// Read from memory\n\t\t\tif (read_en) begin\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= mem[addr_index];\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// PSLVERR is always low for in-range accesses\n\tassign PSLVERR = 1'b0;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
